{"product_id":"half-girlfriend","title":"half girlfriend","description":"\u003cp\u003eHALF GIRLFRIEND (HINDI) Once upon a time, there was a Bihari boy called Madhav. He fell in love with a girl from Delhi called Riya. Madhav didn't speak English well. Riya did. Madhav wanted a relationship. Riya didn't. Riya just wanted friendship. Madhav didn't. Riya suggested a compromise. She agreed to be his half girlfriend. From the author of the blockbuster novels Five Point Someone, One Night @ the Call Center, The 3 Mistakes of My Life, 2 States and Revolution 2020 comes a simple and beautiful love story that will touch your heart and inspire you to chase your dreams. (Written By Chetan Bhagat)\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Chetan Bhagat\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9788129135728\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 260\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 130 x 195\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.in","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41757929963673,"sku":"13RC9788129135728","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/half-girlfriend-729809.jpg?v=1694790556","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/half-girlfriend","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}